# The engine's sources, listed once, for engine/BUILD.gn (the Mac and Linux) and
# engine/android/BUILD.gn (the APK): a file added to one list alone compiled on the Mac and
# failed the APK at its link, an hour into a container build (forms.cc, 2026-11-22). Paths are
# source-absolute, as the two BUILD.gn files sit in different folders. What only one OS builds,
# such as window_mac.mm or the *_android.cc files, stays in that OS's BUILD.gn.

